---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Notice | Fernando Augusto Santos"
  description="Privacy notice for analytics used by the Fernando Augusto Santos portfolio."
  locale="en-GB"
  nav={{ about: 'About', engineering: 'Engineering', experience: 'Experience', work: 'Work', contact: 'Contact', linkedin: 'LinkedIn ↗', menu: 'Menu', openMenu: 'Open menu' }}
  footer={{ role: 'Senior Software Engineer · Florianópolis, Brazil', copyright: '© 2026' }}
>
  <main class="privacy-page">
    <a class="back-link" href="/en/">← Back to portfolio</a>

    <header>
      <p class="kicker">Privacy</p>
      <h1>Privacy Notice</h1>
      <p class="updated">Last updated: 12 September 2026</p>
    </header>

    <section>
      <h2>What is collected</h2>
      <p>This website uses privacy-focused analytics provided by Umami Cloud to understand aggregate website usage and improve the portfolio.</p>
      <p>The analytics service may collect anonymised technical and usage information such as:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>page views and referrer information;</li>
        <li>browser, operating system and device type;</li>
        <li>approximate geographic information such as country, region or city;</li>
        <li>language and UTM campaign parameters when present;</li>
        <li>selected anonymous interaction events, such as clicks on LinkedIn, GitHub, Resume/CV, email and phone links, selected case-study views, language views and reaching the end of a page.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>No names, email addresses, phone numbers or other personally identifying information are intentionally sent to the analytics service by this website.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Privacy measures</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>The analytics tracker does not use cookies.</li>
        <li>This website does not use session replay or heatmaps as part of this analytics setup.</li>
        <li>Analytics data is used for aggregate website measurement and improvement.</li>
        <li>The analytics configuration restricts tracking to the production hostname <code>fstrony.github.io</code>.</li>
        <li>The website does not sell analytics data or use it for advertising.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Third-party service</h2>
      <p>Analytics are provided by Umami Cloud. Umami describes its analytics as privacy-focused, without cookies and without automatic collection of personal data. Umami Cloud operates servers in the United States and European Union.</p>
      <p><a href="https://umami.is/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Umami</a> · <a href="https://docs.umami.is/docs/faq" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Umami privacy FAQ</a></p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>For questions about this website or this privacy notice, contact <a href="mailto:fstrony@gmail.com">fstrony@gmail.com</a>.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Português (Brasil)</h2>
      <p>Este site utiliza analytics com foco em privacidade, fornecido pelo Umami Cloud, para compreender o uso agregado do site e melhorar o portfólio.</p>
      <p>O serviço pode coletar informações técnicas e de uso anonimizadas, como visualizações de páginas, referrer, navegador, sistema operacional, dispositivo, localização geográfica aproximada, idioma, parâmetros UTM e eventos anônimos selecionados de interação. O site não envia intencionalmente nomes, endereços de e-mail, números de telefone ou outras informações que identifiquem diretamente uma pessoa ao serviço de analytics.</p>
      <p>O tracker não utiliza cookies, não utiliza session replay ou heatmaps nesta configuração, restringe o rastreamento ao hostname de produção <code>fstrony.github.io</code> e não utiliza os dados para publicidade.</p>
      <p>Este aviso é uma explicação em linguagem simples sobre o analytics utilizado neste portfólio pessoal. Não constitui aconselhamento jurídico e não substitui quaisquer direitos ou obrigações previstos pelas leis de proteção de dados aplicáveis.</p>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
.privacy-page{width:min(820px,calc(100% - 64px));margin:0 auto;padding:90px 0 130px}.back-link{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}.privacy-page header{border-top:1px solid var(--line);margin-top:28px;padding-top:28px}.privacy-page h1{font-family:'Space Grotesk';font-size:clamp(58px,9vw,100px);line-height:.9;letter-spacing:-.07em;font-weight:500;margin:18px 0}.kicker,.updated{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}.privacy-page section{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:38px 0}.privacy-page h2{font-family:'Space Grotesk';font-size:28px;letter-spacing:-.03em;margin:0 0 18px}.privacy-page p,.privacy-page li{color:#525752;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7}.privacy-page ul{padding-left:22px}.privacy-page code{font-size:.9em}.privacy-page a{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:4px}@media(max-width:820px){.privacy-page{width:calc(100% - 40px);padding:60px 0 90px}.privacy-page h1{font-size:18vw}.privacy-page section{padding:30px 0}}
</style>